  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guidance materials supporting the implementation of the Recommendation on Education for Peace, Human Rights and Sustainable Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the adopted Recommendation on Education for Peace, Human Rights and Sustainable Development in November 2023, this project proposes to create guidance materials for learners, teachers, and civil society members to help support implementation of the Recommendation.

Relevant stakeholder groups will be invited to take part in developing the materials from the very beginning to ensure the end products are relevant and usable. UNESCO will coordinate the efforts and will plan to launch the materials once they are completed. To understand the reach and use of the materials, UNESCO proposes to include an easy-to-use digital reporting mechanism on the materials to gather feedback over time.</narrative>
  </description>
